      "The source unconditionally replaces the last declared layer thickness with mldepth, so subdivision of the existing 50 m column is not the namelist-only change the issue premise described.",
      "The seasonal response is material and strongly conditional on an undeclared diffusivity/profile choice; it is not a small correction.",
      "Every radiative and turbulent watt is still deposited in level 1, so adding levels does not implement the penetrative-shortwave physics that motivated a red-star column.",
